  "body": "If you've been searching for your next renovation project, investment opportunity or a property you can transform into something special, 29 Rewi Street could be just what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nSet on a substantial 1,272m² (more or less) freehold section, this property offers plenty of scope for those with vision and an appetite to add value. The existing home features three bedrooms, two bathrooms, spacious living areas and a large garage or workshop, providing a solid starting point for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nOutside, the generous grounds offer an abundance of space, with extensive parking and room to explore the possibilities. Whether you're looking to renovate, refresh or investigate the property's future potential, there's plenty here to get excited about.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a popular Torbay location, you're just a short distance from local beaches, shops, public transport and everything this sought-after coastal community has to offer.\r\n\r\nBring your tools, bring your imagination and make it your own. Opportunities like this are well worth a closer look!",
